flowchart LR
  A1[死亡 CSV\nDeathCount] --> H1
  A2[国勢調査 CSV\nMaritalPopulation] --> S1[MaritalShare]
  A3[JMD\nExposure] --> E1[StateExposure]
  S1 --> E1
  A4[婚姻 中巻3\nS→M] --> H2
  A5[離婚 中巻3\nM→V] --> H2
  A6[有配偶死亡\nM→W] --> H2
  A7[婚姻 中巻7\nW/V→M] --> R[再婚年齢の意味変換]
  R --> H2
  E1 --> H1[Death Hazard]
  E1 --> H2[Social Hazards]
  H1 --> G[Generator Matrix G(x)]
  H2 --> G
  G --> P[Transition Matrix\nP(x)=expm(5G(x))]
  P --> L[Multi-State Life Table]
  L --> I[Mean age at death / state durations]
